- op: discuss  # b336
  at: '2026-10-28T07:36:52Z'  # b336
  by: agent  # b336
  actor: jgstern_agent  # b336
  clock: 4  # b336
  nonce: b336  # b336
  message: "Fixed in PR #1914 (ccf9c92eeb). The source, sink and sanitizer loaders refuse every key they do not read, top-level and per entry, with TaintCatalogError (exit 2), naming the key, the allowed set and a near-miss suggestion; an attributes: key also says attribute sources come from an io_primitives attributes: row via --io-primitives (WI-jojis). Behavioural evidence: test_taint_catalog_unknown_keys.py::test_verify_claims_refuses_the_file_with_exit_2 (verify-claims --taint-sources with attributes: [location] -> rc 2, stderr names 'attributes'); per-shape refusals for all three files; every shipped file passes. Mutating the refusal away turned 8 of 10 tests red."  # b336
